        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>9.</b> of Number or
			Measurement, with numerals, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τρίτων</span>
			<i>in</i> the third <i>place,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1178
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				500a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Smp.</u>
				213b
			</span></i> ; distributively, <i>apiece,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				15.671b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> of Price, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ὀκτὼ ὀβολῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					2587.206
